- backtest: vectorbt, backtrader
- nlp: transformers, datasets, spacy, finbert (huggingface)
- data: pandas, numpy, ta-lib (bindings), ccxt (if needed)

### Data storage & infra
- TimescaleDB, ClickHouse, Redis, MinIO (S3)

